OL,3,GNEWSAPakistan top court orders ex-PM
OL,4,AImran Khan be moved to hospital from
OL,5,Ajail
OL,6,
OL,7,FPakistan's Supreme Court has ordered
OL,8,Fjailed former Prime Minister Imran Khan
OL,9,Fto be moved to hospital, following
OL,10,Fcomplaints about his poor health.
OL,12,FA three-judge panel ordered that the
OL,13,Fcricketer-turned-politician be taken to
OL,14,FShifa International Hospital in
OL,15,FIslamabad in the next 48 hours to be
OL,16,Fexamined by physicians.
OL,18,FThe court also said Khan would be
OL,19,Fallowed weekly meetings with family
OL,20,Fmembers and telephone calls with his
OL,21,Fsons.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
